# With no structure in x the field is a half cosine between the walls and the index follows from the exact slab index.
# Reference: analytic slab index 2.053320, lowered by the lateral half cosine to 2.051033; agreement limited by the grid.
title 220 nm silicon film, TM, between distant walls
grid dx=0.1 dy=0.01
window width=8 ymin=-1.2 ymax=1.42
layer si 0 0.22
symmetry even
field tm
expect neff 2.052895378 2e-8
expect confinement 0.196272117 1e-6
expect guided no
expect cells 10480
expect neff 2.051033 3e-3
